## Zombie Miasma reagent popup messages
reagent-name-zombie-miasma = zombie miasma
reagent-desc-zombie-miasma = A nauseating miasma exhaled by rotting zombie corpses. Breathing this putrid air in large quantities can infect you with a lesser strain of the Romerol virus.

zombie-miasma-smell = You catch a whiff of something deeply rotten...
zombie-miasma-nausea = The putrid air makes you feel horribly ill.

## Zombie Mutation system
zombie-mutation-ready = Your decaying body strains with unnatural potential. You feel ready to undergo a grotesque transformation.
zombie-mutation-begin = Your body begins to contort and shift horribly...
zombie-mutation-complete-speed = Your rotting muscles tighten. You feel terrifyingly fast.
zombie-mutation-complete-health = Necrotic flesh fills the gaps in your body. You feel indestructible.
zombie-mutation-complete-healing = Your wounds knit together at an unsettling pace. You regenerate rapidly.
zombie-mutation-complete-armor = Your skin hardens into a thick necrotic crust. Blades and bullets find less purchase.
zombie-mutation-complete-virulence = Your bite drips with concentrated rot. The infection you carry is now far more potent.

zombie-mutation-action-name = Undergo Grotesque Mutation
zombie-mutation-action-desc = Stand still and allow your body to undergo a horrific mutation, granting you new zombie abilities or passive buffs.
